/A 2111 0 R
/Alt (The two panel scatter plot compares observed versus predicted concentrations. Panel a shows Zn prediction versus observation for OK, IDW, LM, RF, RFK, and SRK models. Each subplot has a horizontal axis from 0 to 200 and a vertical axis from 0 to 200, both labelled in units of parts per million. A diagonal dashed line represents perfect agreement. A solid blue line indicates the trend. R squared values range from 0.061 for OK to 0.343 for SRK. Panel b shows Co prediction versus observation for the same six models. Each subplot has a horizontal axis from 0 to 90 and a vertical axis from 0 to 90, both labelled in units of parts per million. A diagonal dashed line represents perfect agreement. A solid blue line indicates the trend. R squared values range from 0.145 for OK to 0.353 for SRK. Both panels include a vertical colour bar legend indicating concentration in parts per million.)
/K 1
/P 36 0 R
/Pg 24 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
>>
