/Alt (The six panel figure shows uncertainty analysis for Zn and Co predictions. Panel a displays two spatial maps for Zn uncertainty, with RFK prediction on the left showing higher uncertainty \(darker orange\) and SRK prediction on the right showing lower uncertainty \(lighter blue\). A scale bar indicates 0 to 50 kilometres. Panel b presents a density plot for Zn uncertainty, with RFK \(red curve\) peaking around 11.67 and SRK \(blue curve\) peaking around 13.13. Panel c shows a spatial difference map for Zn uncertainty, with most areas indicating RFK minus SRK values between minus 0.5 and 0.5. Panel d displays two spatial maps for Co uncertainty, with RFK prediction on the left showing higher uncertainty \(darker orange\) and SRK prediction on the right showing lower uncertainty \(lighter blue\). Panel e presents a density plot for Co uncertainty, with RFK \(red curve\) peaking around 6.14 and SRK \(blue curve\) peaking around 6.31. Panel f shows a spatial difference map for Co uncertainty, with most areas indicating RFK minus SRK values between minus 0.1 and 0.1.)
